#: config/config.qml
msgid "General"
msgstr "常规"

#: ui/AppRow.qml
msgctxt "process name and its pid"
msgid "%1 (%2)"
msgstr "%1（%2）"

#: ui/FullRepresentation.qml
msgid "The monitoring service stopped responding"
msgstr "监控服务已停止响应"

#: ui/FullRepresentation.qml
msgid "The monitoring service is not running"
msgstr "监控服务未运行"

#: ui/FullRepresentation.qml
msgid ""
"Start it with:\n"
"sudo systemctl enable --now pnmd"
msgstr ""
"启动命令：\n"
"sudo systemctl enable --now pnmd"

#: ui/FullRepresentation.qml
msgid "No network activity"
msgstr "无网络活动"

#: ui/config/ConfigGeneral.qml
msgid "Title:"
msgstr "标题："

#: ui/config/ConfigGeneral.qml
msgid "Show a title"
msgstr "显示标题"

#: ui/config/ConfigGeneral.qml ui/main.qml
msgid "Network Top"
msgstr "网络占用"

#: ui/config/ConfigGeneral.qml
msgid "Applications to list:"
msgstr "列表显示数量："

#: ui/config/ConfigGeneral.qml
msgid "Show:"
msgstr "显示："

#: ui/config/ConfigGeneral.qml
msgid "Total throughput"
msgstr "总吞吐量"

#: ui/config/ConfigGeneral.qml
msgid "Rate history graphs"
msgstr "速率历史曲线"

#: ui/config/ConfigGeneral.qml
msgid "Binary units (KiB/s) instead of decimal (kB/s)"
msgstr "使用二进制单位（KiB/s）而非十进制（kB/s）"

#: ui/config/ConfigGeneral.qml
msgid "Panel entry shows:"
msgstr "面板中显示："

#: ui/config/ConfigGeneral.qml
msgid "Animations:"
msgstr "动画："

#: ui/config/ConfigGeneral.qml
msgid "Animate list changes"
msgstr "为列表变化播放动画"

#: ui/config/ConfigGeneral.qml
msgid "Speed:"
msgstr "速度："

#: ui/config/ConfigGeneral.qml
msgctxt "animation speed as a multiple of the normal speed"
msgid "%1×"
msgstr "%1×"

#: ui/config/ConfigGeneral.qml
msgid ""
"Scales the durations on top of the system-wide animation speed. Higher is "
"faster."
msgstr "在系统全局动画速度的基础上缩放时长，数值越大越快。"

#: ui/config/ConfigGeneral.qml
msgid "Busiest application"
msgstr "占用最高的应用"

#: ui/config/ConfigGeneral.qml
msgid "Busiest application's icon with total throughput"
msgstr "占用最高应用的图标与总吞吐量"

#: ui/config/ConfigGeneral.qml
msgid "Refresh interval:"
msgstr "刷新间隔："

#: ui/config/ConfigGeneral.qml
msgid "%1 ms"
msgstr "%1 毫秒"

#: ui/config/ConfigGeneral.qml
msgid "Match this to the interval the daemon was started with."
msgstr "应与守护进程启动时所用的间隔保持一致。"

#: ui/config/ConfigGeneral.qml
msgid "Keep idle applications for:"
msgstr "闲置应用保留时长："

#: ui/config/ConfigGeneral.qml
msgid "Remove immediately"
msgstr "立即移除"

#: ui/config/ConfigGeneral.qml
msgid "%1 second"
msgid_plural "%1 seconds"
msgstr[0] "%1 秒"

#: ui/config/ConfigGeneral.qml
msgid ""
"An application that stops transferring stays in the list, dimmed, for this "
"long before fading out. Without it, anything bursty flickers in and out once "
"a second."
msgstr ""
"停止传输的应用会以变暗状态在列表中保留这段时间，之后淡出。否则突发性的流量会"
"让列表每秒闪进闪出。"

#: ui/config/ConfigGeneral.qml
msgid "Exclude processes:"
msgstr "排除进程："

#: ui/config/ConfigGeneral.qml
msgid "Comma-separated process names"
msgstr "以逗号分隔的进程名"

#: ui/config/ConfigGeneral.qml
msgid ""
"A TUN-mode proxy relays traffic through its own sockets, so every byte is "
"counted twice — once for the application and once for the proxy. Excluding "
"the proxy here restores the real figures."
msgstr ""
"TUN 模式代理会通过自己的套接字中转流量，因此每个字节都会被统计两次——一次记在"
"应用上，一次记在代理上。在此排除代理进程即可还原真实数值。"

#: ui/config/ConfigGeneral.qml
msgid "Snapshot file:"
msgstr "快照文件："

#: ui/main.qml
msgid "The pnmd service is not running."
msgstr "pnmd 服务未运行。"

#: ui/main.qml
msgid "The pnmd service stopped responding."
msgstr "pnmd 服务已停止响应。"

#: ui/main.qml
msgid "No network activity."
msgstr "无网络活动。"

#: ui/main.qml
msgid "%1 — down %2, up %3"
msgstr "%1 — 下行 %2，上行 %3"
